                            "I just want to do what is right."
                        </p>
                        <p style="color: var(--text-light);">— Craig Rogers</p>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>
    </section>

    <!-- Why This Award Exists -->
    <section class="content-section bg-light">
        <div class="container">
