                        at mock jobsites. Learn best practices, understand utility marking standards, and develop 
                        the skills needed for safe excavation.
                    </p>
                    
                    <div style="display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(300px, 1fr)); gap: 1.5rem; margin: 2rem 0;">
                        <div>
                            <img src="assets/images/programs/education/Picture3-e1739554999401.jpg" alt="NRCGA Training Session" style="width: 100%; border-radius: 12px; box-shadow: var(--shadow-md);" onerror="this.style.display=''none''">
                        </div>
                        <div>
                            <img src="assets/images/programs/education/Picture5-e1739468922376.jpg" alt="NRCGA Training Session" style="width: 100%; border-radius: 12px; box-shadow: var(--shadow-md);" onerror="this.style.display=''none''">
                        </div>
                    </div>

                </div>
            </div>
        </div>
    </section>

    <!-- Training Details -->
    <section class="content-section bg-light">
        <div class="container">
            <div class="section-header">
                <h2 class="section-title">What You''ll Learn</h2>
                <p class="section-subtitle">Our training covers essential topics for safe excavation and damage prevention.</p>
            </div>

            <div class="features-grid">
                <div class="feature-item">
                    <div class="feature-icon">🎯</div>
                    <h3>Utility Marking Standards</h3>
                    <p>Understand color codes, marking standards, and how to interpret utility locator marks.</p>
                </div>
                <div class="feature-item">
                    <div class="feature-icon">🛠️</div>
                    <h3>Safe Excavation Practices</h3>
                    <p>Learn proper hand-digging techniques and safe distances from marked utilities.</p>
                </div>
                <div class="feature-item">
                    <div class="feature-icon">📞</div>
                    <h3>811 Process</h3>
                    <p>Master the call-before-you-dig process and ticket management.</p>
                </div>
                <div class="feature-item">
                    <div class="feature-icon">⚠️</div>
                    <h3>Damage Prevention</h3>
                    <p>Identify potential hazards and prevent damage to underground infrastructure.</p>
                </div>
                <div class="feature-item">
                    <div class="feature-icon">📋</div>
                    <h3>Best Practices</h3>
                    <p>Industry standards and proven methods for safe excavation operations.</p>
                </div>
                <div class="feature-item">
                    <div class="feature-icon">🤝</div>
                    <h3>Communication</h3>
                    <p>Effective communication with utility operators and locators.</p>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>
    </section>', NULL, 1, 0);
